 624 001604  1021          TAD ALIVE       /NOW SEE IF ALIVE
 625 001605  7650          SNA CLA         /SKIP IF ALIVE AND WELL
 626 001606  5600          JMP I CALPNT    /HAS BIT THE DUST
 627 001607  1036          TAD QSHIPN      /NUMBER OF POINTS IN SHIP
